<title>UK: London shipsales.</title>
<headline>London shipsales.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Secondhand tonnage brokers reported the sale of the following vessels on Friday.</p>
<p>BULKERS - Cargo Emerald - (built 1978) 36,071 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $6.1 million.</p>
<p>TWEENDECKERS - Anixis - (built 1974) 15,022 dwt sold to Greek buyers for $1 million.</p>
<p>RORO - Gruz - (built 1986) 4,244 dwt sold to French buyers for $5.5 million.</p>
<p>COMBINATION CARRIERS - Bona Falcon - (built 1981) 82,462 dwt sold to Italian buyers for $13 million. --London Newsroom, +44 171 542 8071</p>
</text>
